{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113180","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1111318001:0":{"text":"扔掉那个笛子！很危险！","source_cn":"扔掉那个笛子！很危险！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E48717A6F0A541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111318002:0":{"text":"不能扔！这是我的宝物！没了它，我再也不能和爸爸妈妈说话了！","source_cn":"不能扔！这是我的宝物！没了它，我再也不能和爸爸妈妈说话了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135E4B3DB12C027B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111318003:1":{"text":"那是个笛子，你要怎么用它和去世的人说话呀！","source_cn":"那是个笛子，你要怎么用它和去世的人说话呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8155DD8E95F45056","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111318004:0":{"text":"怎么不能！只要用它吹响旋律，就能听见爸爸妈妈的声音！","source_cn":"怎么不能！只要用它吹响旋律，就能听见爸爸妈妈的声音！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FCAD6A62D67FEA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111318005:0":{"text":"你果然很坏！你抢我的安丹姐姐，还要抢我的笛子！","source_cn":"你果然很坏！你抢我的安丹姐姐，还要抢我的笛子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FD4E8277893B7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat